# Build / run detritus
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.log
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.Rhistory
.RData

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal working material — removed from history 2026-09-10 before the
# repository was made public, and ignored so it cannot be re-added.
#   - peer-review correspondence is confidential to the journal and reviewers
#   - narrative/story planning documents are internal author material
#   - agent session logs and local settings are machine-specific
#   - the two retracted-model renders must not be reachable by figure-slot
#     lookup: Figure5_gatekeeper_model is the withdrawn four-tier Gatekeeper
#     model, Figure2c_shielded_exposed the withdrawn Shielded/Exposed panel
# The files remain on the author's disk; only git ignores them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
**/.claude/
00_memo/
Daily/
Writing/Reviewer-Response-Draft.md
Writing/story_and_outline_draft.md
Writing/story_options_for_author.md
Writing/draft_hi-c_paragraph.md
Writing/draft_pisciotta_reinterpretation.md
**/story_option_b_overview*
**/figure_plan_storyB*
**/Figure5_gatekeeper_model.*
**/Figure2c_shielded_exposed.*

# 寄託の内部事務（ローカル保持・公開しない）
# ローカル絶対パス、md5 表、NCBI との往復、採取日を含み、読者の再現性には不要。
# 生成は deposition/build_submission_metadata.py（手元で実行）。
deposition/

# 第三者の著作物・第三者の連絡先（公開リポには置かない。いずれも一次配布元から再取得可能）
# - 出版社 PDF: 再配布可否がライセンス次第。解析の再現には不要
# - NCBI assembly_data_report.jsonl: 投稿者の個人メールアドレス 6 件を含む
**/literature/
reference/
**/assembly_data_report.jsonl
**/pnas.*.sapp.pdf
**/sapp.txt
Rplots.pdf
.tmp_fig.py

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Structure-search databases and model downloads (107_MTase_candidate_triage).
# 6.0 GB of third-party data, re-fetchable from its primary source; the single
# largest file (PDB_seq_ca.1, 2.09 GB) exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
#   - data/fsdb/     : foldseek PDB database  (foldseek databases PDB <out> <tmp>)
#   - data/af_models/: AlphaFold/RCSB structures (URLs recorded in data/af_urls.json)
# The derived evidence that the manuscript rests on -- foldseek_hits.tsv,
# the elimination table and the report -- IS tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/data/fsdb/
**/data/af_models/

# Index of an ignored FASTA (samtools faidx regenerates it)
*.fna.fai

# Pipeline smoke-test scratch
**/data/test_query.faa
**/data/test_hits.tsv
**/logs/test_*.err

# 投稿手続き上の文書（カバーレター草稿・査読応答骨子）はコードアーカイブの対象外。
# 再現性に寄与せず、撤回済みの主張を現役として記述しているため 2026-10-15 に除外した。
# ローカルには残してある。
out_nar_revision_260716/

